\subsection{Proof of Theorem \ref{cig}}

We recall that the automorphism group $G'$ of $\mathbf{F}_{2p}$ is isomorphic to  \begin{equation}\label{ppf}
 \langle A, B, S, R :  A^{2p},B^{2p},R^3,S^2,(SR)^2,[A,B],1, RAR^{-1}(AB), RBR^{-1}A^{-1}, SAS(AB), [S,B]\rangle,
