\title[Dual-Attention U-Net++ with Class-Specific Ensembles and Bayesian Hyperparameter Optimization for Precise Wound and Scale Marker Segmentation]{Dual-Attention U-Net++ with Class-Specific Ensembles and Bayesian Hyperparameter Optimization for Precise Wound and Scale Marker Segmentation}

