\section{Results}\label{sec:results}

Our proposed dual-attention U-Net++ architecture, optimized via Bayesian sweeps, was evaluated on the NBC 2025 \& PCBBE 2025 segmentation challenge. Due to dataset imbalance, we trained separate models for wounds and scale markers, achieving robust internal validation scores as summarized in Table~\ref{tab:validation_results}.

