\subsection{Research Goals and Questions}
The goal of this work is to help identify sustainability within architecturally relevant posts about cloud computing, such as those found in posts on Q\&A platforms like Stack Exchange. We believe this goal can be better explained using the design science framework stated by Wieringa~\cite{wieringa2014design}. According to this framework, we break the goal into two different questions, one design problem (or technical research question) and a knowledge question. The former calls for a change in the problem context by creating an artifact or a solution, while the latter asks for knowledge about the artifact in the context. %The above goal is detailed in the following research question:
