\textbf{RQ2: How can architecturally relevant posts be detected?}
For this study, it is essential to explore posts related to cloud architecture, as our goal is to examine them from a software architecture perspective. Additionally, the sustainability indicators we use are derived from the sustainability pillar of the cloud providers' well-architected framework, which offers solutions for effective architectural design. However, identifying architectural discussions can be achieved by leveraging pre-existing datasets to train a machine learning model. To ensure consistent identification of architectural discussions, we formulated this research question, which aims to classify Stack Overflow posts using a BERT model based on different architectural phases: analysis, synthesis, and evaluation.\\
