%The independent variable refers to the factor that we manipulate or change to observe its effect.
We have a few independent variables presented in Table~\ref{tab:variables} related to the experience and characteristics of the experiment participants, which could potentially influence the outcomes of the experiment. 
The data includes the students' master track, year of study (1st or 2nd year), and their level of sustainability knowledge. Students may belong to one of three master tracks and gain sustainability knowledge through course slides, attending the sustainability lecture, or prior experience. They can select multiple options to describe their knowledge.% The course will be introduced in Section~\ref{sec:subjects}.
