\subsubsection{Certainty of identifying sustainability in the posts}
According to Table~\ref{tab:stats}, the F group exhibits a slight inclination towards higher certainty levels, as evidenced by a higher mean, a higher mode bin closer to the maximum value, and a marginally lower range and lower spread of intervals around the mean. While the differences between groups are subtle, F group appears to express slightly greater certainty, with ratings more concentrated around higher certainty levels.
