    We can also analyze the uniformity of the market, as you can see in Figure \ref{fig:geminia_pv}, compared to other markets the traders do seem to have a more varied earning profile. This is also shown in the Portfolio Value variance which is: 45.58, higher than all but one of the other single-model markets. 

