\item $G = {\rm P\O}_8^{+}(3).X$: $K = O_3(N_G(P))$, where $P = P_{1,3,4}$ is a parabolic subgroup of $G_0$ corresponding to the central node in the Dynkin diagram of type $D_4$. We note that $|H:K| = 3$.

