    \caption{\textbf{Markov state diagram for the reaction scheme in Eq.~\eqref{eq:modTM} for states up to mRNA number $n=3$}. Arrow labels indicate the propensity at which transitions between each state occur. Since every reaction can occur in both directions, the telegraph model is a dynamically reversible non-equilibrium system. Generally, detailed balance is not satisfied.}
    \label{fig:markov-d-TM}
