\title{Efficient Reallocation of Indivisible Resources: Pair-efficiency versus Pareto-efficiency\thanks{I am grateful to Szilvia P\'{a}pai for helpful discussions. I also appreciate the helpful suggestions provided by three anonymous referees.}}

